<title>SWEDEN: AGA says buys Ukraine's Dneprokisen.</title>
<headline>AGA says buys Ukraine's Dneprokisen.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish industrial and medical gas company AGA AB said on Thursday it bought a majority stake in the largest industrial gas company in the Ukraine, Dneprokisen.</p>
